# error: expected `(const u8[])[]`, got `(const u8[])[2]`: a span with mutable elements
## §5.3, §5.4: `const` binds to the innermost type, so `const u8[][]` is a span with
## mutable elements, each a `const u8[]`; a literal makes only a read-only span, written
## `const (const u8[])[]`.
let words: const u8[][] = [b"a", b"bc"]

pub func main(arguments: str[]) -> i32:
    return 0
